{"sha": "757253aa4f5fc216b3f2446d0a8cdc83c56392d0d86d75d7f1de15fa886567a0", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:seq} 章 --- 数列}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:seq:1}", "$\\Bigl|\\dfrac{2n+1}{n+3} - 2\\Bigr| = \\dfrac{5}{n+3}$。给定", "$\\varepsilon > 0$，由阿基米德性质取 $N > \\frac 5\\varepsilon - 3$：", "当 $n \\geq N$ 时，$\\frac{5}{n+3} \\leq \\varepsilon$。于是极限为", "$2$。", "", "$((-1)^n)$：其子列 $(u_{2n}) = (1)$ 与 $(u_{2n+1}) =", "(-1)$ 收敛于不同的极限，因此该数列发散", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:seq:subsequences}）。（直接验证：任取候选极限 $\\ell$", "对 $\\varepsilon = \\frac12$ 不满足定义，因相邻两项的距离为", "$2$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:seq:2}", "两边同除以 $n^2$：$\\dfrac{1 - 3/n + 1/n^2}{2 + 5/n^2} \\to", "\\dfrac12$。", "", "$\\sqrt{n+1} - \\sqrt n = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n+1} + \\sqrt n} \\to 0$", "（利用共轭式）。", "", "$\\dfrac{2^n + n^3}{3^n - n^2} = \\dfrac{(2/3)^n + n^3/3^n}{1 -", "n^2/3^n} \\to \\dfrac{0 + 0}{1 - 0} = 0$，利用 $q^n \\to 0$（$\\abs q", "< 1$ 时），以及多项式与等比数列的比较", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:functions:powerrules}）。", "", "$5^{1/n} = \\eu^{\\frac{\\ln 5}{n}} \\to \\eu^0 = 1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:seq:3}", "伯努利不等式：$(1+h)^n \\geq 1 + nh$，其中 $h \\geq -1$，用归纳法证明 ---", "$(1+h)^{n+1} = (1+h)^n(1+h) \\geq (1+nh)(1+h) = 1 + (n+1)h + nh^2", "\\geq 1 + (n+1)h$。", "", "当 $0 < \\abs q < 1$ 时，记 $\\frac{1}{\\abs q} = 1 + h$，$h > 0$，则", "$\\abs{q}^n = \\frac{1}{(1+h)^n} \\leq \\frac{1}{1 + nh} \\to 0$，由夹逼准则", "可得 $q^n \\to 0$（$q = 0$ 时平凡）。对 $q = 1$：", "为常数列，极限为 $1$。对 $q = -1$，数列发散", "（见\\cref{exo:b1:seq:1}）。对 $\\abs q > 1$，$\\abs q^n = (1 + h)^n \\geq", "1 + nh \\to +\\infty$，故 $(q^n)$ 无界，从而发散（", "趋于 $+\\infty$，若 $q > 1$；若 $q <", "-1$，则符号交替，无极限）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:seq:4}", "不动点：由 $\\ell = \\frac{\\ell + 3}{2}$ 得 $\\ell = 3$。于是", "\\[", "v_{n+1} = u_{n+1} - 3 = \\frac{u_n + 3}{2} - 3 = \\frac{u_n - 3}{2} =", "\\frac{v_n}{2}:", "\\]", "$(v_n)$ 是公比为 $\\frac12$ 的等比数列，$v_0 = -3$。于是 $u_n = 3 -", "\\frac{3}{2^n} \\to 3$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:seq:5}", "$H_{2n} - H_n = \\sum_{k=n+1}^{2n} \\frac 1k \\geq n \\cdot", "\\frac{1}{2n} = \\frac12$（这 $n$ 项中每项都 $\\geq", "\\frac{1}{2n}$）。假设 $(H_n)$ 为柯西序列，取 $\\varepsilon =", "\\frac13$ 时必有 $\\abs{H_{2n} - H_n} \\leq \\frac13$，对充分大的", "$n$ 成立，矛盾。单调递增而不收敛的数列发散到", "$+\\infty$（见\\cref{thm:b1:seq:monotone}）：$H_n \\to +\\infty$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:seq:6}", "设 $a = \\lim u_{2n}$，$b = \\lim u_{2n+1}$，$c = \\lim u_{3n}$。", "数列 $(u_{6n})$ 既是 $(u_{2n})$ 的子列，也是", "$(u_{3n})$ 的子列，其极限同时为 $a$ 与 $c$，故 $a = c$。数列", "$(u_{6n+3})$ 是 $(u_{2n+1})$ 的子列（下标为奇数），也是", "$(u_{3n})$ 的子列（下标为 $6n + 3 = 3(2n+1)$），故 $b = c$。于是 $a = b$，", "由\\cref{prop:b1:seq:subsequences}（偶数项与奇数项的极限", "相等）可知 $(u_n)$ 收敛。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:seq:7}", "\\emph{稳定性与界：}$I = \\intcc{0}{2}$ 是稳定的：对 $x \\in", "I$，$\\sqrt{2 + x} \\in \\intcc{\\sqrt 2}{2} \\subseteq I$；且 $u_0 = 0", "\\in I$。", "", "\\emph{单调性：}$f(x) = \\sqrt{2+x}$ 单调递增，且 $u_1 =", "\\sqrt 2 > u_0$，由归纳法得 $(u_n)$ 单调递增，", "且有上界 $2$，因此", "由\\cref{thm:b1:seq:monotone}可知它收敛。", "", "\\emph{极限：}由 $\\ell = \\sqrt{2 + \\ell}$，$\\ell \\geq 0$，得", "$\\ell^2 - \\ell - 2 = 0$，故 $\\ell = 2$。", "", "\\emph{误差估计：}乘以共轭式，", "\\[", "2 - u_{n+1} = 2 - \\sqrt{2 + u_n}", "= \\frac{4 - (2 + u_n)}{2 + \\sqrt{2+u_n}}", "= \\frac{2 - u_n}{2 + \\sqrt{2 + u_n}}", "\\leq \\frac{2 - u_n}{3},", "\\]", "由于 $\\sqrt{2 + u_n} \\geq \\sqrt 2 > 1$。由归纳法，从 $2 - u_0", "= 2$ 出发，可得 $\\;0 \\leq 2 - u_n \\leq \\frac{2}{3^n}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:seq:8}", "假设 $(u_n)$ 不收敛于 $\\ell$：存在 $\\varepsilon_0", "> 0$，使得无穷多个下标满足 $\\abs{u_n - \\ell} >", "\\varepsilon_0$，这些下标构成子列 $(u_{\\varphi(n)})$。", "该子列有界，故由波尔查诺–魏尔斯特拉斯定理", "（见\\cref{thm:b1:seq:bw}）可知它有一收敛的子子列，其极限", "$\\ell'$ 满足 $\\abs{\\ell' - \\ell} \\geq \\varepsilon_0$", "（对不等式取极限，见\\cref{thm:b1:seq:order}）。但", "$(u_n)$ 的子子列也是 $(u_n)$ 的收敛子列，", "故由假设 $\\ell' = \\ell$，矛盾。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}